      0xd4 "Inactive: brake pedal state unknown"
      0xd5 "Inactive: vehicle in motion"
      0xd6 "Inactive: vehicle speed unknown"
      0xd7 "Inactive: transmission in gear"
      0xd8 "Inactive: secondary speed control active"
