      1 "Inactive: engine stopped"
      2 "Inactive: other diagnostic running"
      10 "Inactive"
      20 "Completed"
      30 "Active: increasing speed"
      31 "Active: waiting for fan speed #1"
      32 "Active: checking fan speed #1"
      33 "Active: waiting for fan speed #2"
      34 "Active: checking fan speed #2"
      35 "Active: returning to idle"
